! Task:
! 
! Create an implementation of the classic Mill game.
! 
! The game is also known as Nine Men's Morris, Mill, Mills, Merels,
! Merelles y Merrills.
! 
! In Spanish, it is known as juego del molino or molino; in French, as jeu
! du moulin; and in Piedmontese, as grisha.
! 
! Is an ancient tabletop board game for two players. The aim of the game
! is to remove your opponent's game pieces (called "men") one at a time,
! by moving 3 of your own "men" into a row (called a "mill").
! 
! Each "mill" you make gives you the power to select one of your
! opponent's men for removal.
! 
! While moving your pieces, you can use tactics and strategy to block your
! opponent from building his own "mill".
! 
! References:
! 
! -   Article: wikipedia Nine men's morris
! -   Article: Play on-line


